==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|wonēn}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*wunaną}}, {{m|gem-pro|*wunēną}}, {{m|gem-pro|*wunajaną||to love, wish}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*wenh₁-||to wish, love}}. Compare {{cog|yi|וווינען}}, {{cog|osx|wunon}} ({{cog|nds|wanen}}) , {{cog|nl|wonen}}, {{cog|ang|wunian}} ({{cog|en|wone}}).

